    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand what's being tested.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — removing unused imports/fields, renaming cryptic variables, and adding brief clarifying comments.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: removed all unused imports and the unused `BASE64_IMPOSSIBLE_CASES` field, renamed `ru_msg`/`ch_msg` to `russianText`/`swissGermanText`, reformatted the unicode arrays for readability, and added brief comments identifying the human-readable meaning of each string and explaining the two assertion groups (expected encoding and round-trip verification)."
    }
